  </div>
  <div class="agents-route reveal" role="img" aria-label="Glimmervoid starts and watches each agent CLI from the side. The CLI is Claude Code or Codex, unmodified, with your own login, subscription, skills, hooks, MCP servers and settings, and it talks directly to your model provider. Glimmervoid is not on that line.">
